        "id": 5065
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-06-29T15:11:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I used SkMatrix because fInitialPositionMatrix is referred to by \u0026 (I assume to avoid a copy), and I don\u0027t want to affect Ganesh. I suppose it doesn\u0027t matter whether the conversion is done up front or at the end.",
